Job Specifications
Duties and responsibilities entail:
An officer at this level will work under supervision and guidance of a Director.
Duties and responsibilities at this level will entail:
Controlling and monitoring use of official motor vehicles by authorizing motor vehicle movements through work tickets, maintenance of accurate transport records and ensuring regular and scheduled maintenance;
Coordinating transport staff and allocate appropriate duties;
Coordinating cleaning contracted staff;
Supervising issues of fuel orders, fuel cards and preparing fuel consumption reports on monthly basis;
Supporting staff in terms of identifying office accommodation and space for staff;
Providing tools, equipment and good working environment;
Ensuring that offices and other facilities are kept clean to the highest standards;
Ensuring that staff are provided with tea and drinking water in time; Acquiring and renewal of licenses;
